      "nota": "<a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castello_di_Bardi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bardi Castle</a> is an imposing fortification in the province of <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Castello+di+Bardi/@44.6300977,9.7300151,601m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x47809cce32574b8f:0x81e7bbb90bfa716a!8m2!3d44.6290623!4d9.7311395!16s%2Fg%2F121zcqn8?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTEyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Parma</a>.\nIt is very well preserved, and almost the entire structure is open to visitors. It features a labyrinth of furnished rooms, towers, and bastions. There are also dungeons, a torture chamber, and even tales of sightings of a knight’s ghost."
